    {
      "name": "dsh-knowledge-work-operations",
      "title": {
        "en": "Operations role plugin",
        "zh": "运营专员岗位插件"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "An operations role pack for non-technical colleagues: turns capacity planning, change management, process SOPs, process optimisation, risk assessment, runbooks, status reporting, vendor review, and compliance tracking into loadable SOP skills, and adds an Operations specialist agent preset you can switch to per session. Its skills appear only in sessions that select that preset, so ordinary sessions are unchanged. Skill bodies are ported from the operations plugin of anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins (Apache-2.0), localised to Chinese, with no Claude subscription required. All connectors are optional: where a skill touches calendar/ITSM/project-tracker actions, connect the matching service in the MCP settings page; without one, provide the content manually or paste data and the core workflow still works.",
        "zh": "给非技术同事的运营岗位包：把「产能规划、变更管理、流程 SOP、流程优化、风险评估、值班手册、状态汇报、供应商评审、合规跟踪」变成可加载的中文 SOP 技能，并新增一个「运营专员」Agent 预设（可在会话的模式选择里切换）。技能只在该预设的会话里出现，不影响普通会话。技能正文移植自 anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins 的 operations 插件（Apache-2.0），已中文化并去掉 Claude 订阅依赖。连接器全部可选：涉及日历/ITSM/项目跟踪等操作时，需在设置的 MCP 页面自行连接对应服务；未连接时改为手动提供内容或粘贴数据，主体功能照常可用。"
      },
