    {
      "name": "dsh-knowledge-work-productivity",
      "title": {
        "en": "Productivity role plugin",
        "zh": "效率助手岗位插件"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A productivity role pack: turns task tracking, workplace memory (people, projects, shorthand), and a visual dashboard into loadable Chinese SOP skills, and adds a Productivity assistant agent preset you can switch to per session. Its skills appear only in sessions that select that preset, so ordinary sessions are unchanged. Skill bodies are ported from the productivity plugin of anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins (Apache-2.0), localised to Chinese, and rewritten against DSH — no Claude subscription required. Optional connectors: add Slack / Notion / Asana / Linear / Jira / Monday / ClickUp / Google Calendar / Gmail MCP servers in the MCP settings page for automatic sync and deep scans; without any connector, task-management is fully usable and memory-management / start / update degrade to semi-automatic (paste content manually).",
        "zh": "效率岗位包：把「任务清单、职场记忆（人物/项目/术语速记）、可视化看板」变成可加载的中文 SOP 技能，并新增一个「效率助手」Agent 预设（可在会话的模式选择里切换）。技能只在该预设的会话里出现，不影响普通会话。技能正文移植自 anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins 的 productivity 插件（Apache-2.0），已中文化并适配 DSH，不需要 Claude 订阅。可选连接器：需要在 设置→MCP 连接 Slack / Notion / Asana / Linear / Jira / Monday / ClickUp / Google 日历 / Gmail 才能自动同步与深度扫描；不接连接器时，task-management 完整可用，memory-management / start / update 降级为半自动（需手动粘贴内容）。"
      },
